(2) Chief of Cordele Police Department;
(3) Chief of Cordele Fire Department;
(4) Sheriff of Crisp County;
(5) U.S. Postmaster of Cordele;
(6) Director of Housing and Urban Advancement;
(7) Director of Crisp County Emergency Medical Services;
(8) Director of Cordele Public Works Department.
